<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SkillWap Esprit · Time Banking</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* ----- RESET & BASE ----- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f0f4f9;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        /* ----- MAIN CARD – glassmorphism + epic shadow ----- */
        .home-card {
            max-width: 1300px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            border-radius: 32px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), 0 10px 30px rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* ----- NAVBAR – epic & clean ----- */
        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 22px 48px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px 30px;
        }

        .nav-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .nav-brand i {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a0c0c, #b31b1b);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.3);
        }

        .nav-brand span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a0c0c, #b31b1b);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 32px;
            list-style: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #1e2e3f;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            position: relative;
            padding: 4px 0;
        }

        .nav-links a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -2px;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2.5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7a0c0c, #b31b1b);
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover::after,
        .nav-links a.active::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .nav-links a.active {
            color: #7a0c0c;
        }

        .btn-signup {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a0c0c, #a31515);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 60px;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #fff !important;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.35);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .btn-signup:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.45);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8f0e0e, #b81a1a);
        }

        .btn-signup i {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* ----- HERO SECTION – epic & user-friendly ----- */
        .hero-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 50px 48px 60px;
            gap: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #fafcff);
        }

        .hero-text {
            flex: 1.2;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.08);
            color: #7a0c0c;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.12);
        }

        .hero-badge i {
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 54px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.08;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .hero-text h1 .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a0c0c, #b31b1b);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #3d4f60;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .hero-text p i {
            color: #7a0c0c;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .hero-text .sub-highlight {
            color: #7a0c0c;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* epic stats row */
        .stats-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 30px 50px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-top: 2px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
        }

        .stat-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .stat-item .icon-wrap {
            background: rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.08);
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #7a0c0c;
        }

        .stat-item .number {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .stat-item .label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4d6275;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* CTA group */
        .cta-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px 30px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1a2a, #1a3147);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 60px;
            padding: 16px 44px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(11, 26, 42, 0.3);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(11, 26, 42, 0.4);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #122b3f, #1f3d57);
        }

        .btn-primary i {
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #7a0c0c;
            border-radius: 60px;
            padding: 14px 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #7a0c0c;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #7a0c0c;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.3);
        }

        .cta-link {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #7a0c0c;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .cta-link:hover {
            border-bottom-color: #7a0c0c;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        /* right visual – epic image with overlay */
        .hero-visual {
            flex: 1;
            min-height: 380px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .hero-visual:hover {
            transform: scale(1.01);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
        }

        .hero-visual::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.08), rgba(11, 26, 42, 0.12));
            border-radius: 24px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero-visual .floating-badge {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 24px;
            left: 24px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-visual .floating-badge i {
            color: #7a0c0c;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* ----- CONCEPT SECTION – Time Banking explanation ----- */
        .concept-section {
            padding: 40px 48px 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #f0f4f9);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
        }

        .concept-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        .concept-header h2 {
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .concept-header h2 span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a0c0c, #b31b1b);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .concept-header p {
            color: #4d6275;
            font-size: 17px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 8px auto 0;
        }

        .concept-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .concept-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 28px 22px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .concept-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-color: rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.15);
        }

        .concept-card .icon {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            background: rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.08);
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #7a0c0c;
            margin: 0 auto 14px;
        }

        .concept-card h4 {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .concept-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4d6275;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ----- FEATURES SECTION ----- */
        .features-section {
            padding: 40px 48px 50px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(122, 12, 12, 0.06);
        }

        .features-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        .features-header h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .features-header p {
            color: #4d6275;
            font-size: 17px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 8px auto 0;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #eaeef3;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-color: #7a0c0c;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        .feature-card .icon {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #7a0c0c;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .feature-card h4 {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0b1a2a;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4d6275;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ----- RESPONSIVE ----- */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 42px;
            }
            .navbar {
                padding: 18px 30px;
            }
            .hero-section {
                padding: 40px 30px 50px;
                gap: 30px;
            }
            .concept-section,
            .features-section {
                padding: 30px 30px 40px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .hero-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 30px 24px 40px;
            }
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }
            .hero-visual {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: 260px;
            }
            .stats-row {
                gap: 20px 30px;
            }
            .navbar {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
                gap: 12px;
            }
            .nav-links {
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 18px;
            }
            .btn-signup {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .concept-grid,
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .navbar {
                padding: 16px 18px;
            }
            .nav-links {
                font-size: 13px;
                gap: 12px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
            .hero-text p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
            .stat-item .number {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .stat-item .icon-wrap {
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
                font-size: 18px;
            }
            .btn-primary,
            .btn-secondary {
                padding: 14px 28px;
                font-size: 14px;
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .cta-group {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
            .concept-grid,
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .concept-section,
            .features-section {
                padding: 24px 18px 30px;
            }
            .concept-header h2,
            .features-header h2 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }
            .hero-visual .floating-badge {
                bottom: 16px;
                left: 16px;
                padding: 10px 18px;
                font-size: 12px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="home-card">

        <!-- ===== NAVBAR ===== -->
        <nav class="navbar">
            <a href="#" class="nav-brand">
                <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>
                SkillWap <span>Esprit</span>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#" class="active">HOME</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">SKILLS</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">EXCHANGE</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">ABOUT</a></li>
                <li>
                    <a href="#" class="btn-signup">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> SIGN UP
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </nav>

        <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
        <div class="hero-section">

            <!-- left text -->
            <div class="hero-text">
                <div class="hero-badge">
                    <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Time Banking · Troc de Compétences
                </div>

                <h1>
                    Level up <br>
                    <span class="highlight">Your Career</span>
                </h1>

                <p>
                    <i>Échangez vos compétences</i> sans argent — 
                    <span class="sub-highlight">1 heure donnée = 1 heure reçue</span>.
                    Apprenez, enseignez et grandissez avec notre communauté.
                </p>

                <!-- epic stats -->
                <div class="stats-row">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="number">2.4k+</div>
                            <span class="label">Membres actifs</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-clock"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="number">8.7k</div>
                            <span class="label">Heures échangées</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="number">4.9</div>
                            <span class="label">Note moyenne</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- CTA group -->
                <div class="cta-group">
                    <a href="#" class="btn-primary">
                        <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> Commencer
                    </a>
                    <a href="#" class="btn-secondary">
                        <i class="fas fa-search"></i> Explorer
                    </a>
                    <a href="#" class="cta-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-passport"></i> En savoir plus
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- right visual -->
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="floating-badge">
                    <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i> 1h = 1 crédit
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- ===== CONCEPT SECTION – Time Banking ===== -->
        <div class="concept-section">
            <div class="concept-header">
                <h2>Le concept : <span>Time Banking</span></h2>
                <p>Remplacez l'argent par le temps et les compétences — 1 heure donnée = 1 heure reçue</p>
            </div>
            <div class="concept-grid">
                <div class="concept-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i></div>
                    <h4>Valorisez vos compétences</h4>
                    <p>Langues, programmation, musique, design, cuisine — partagez votre savoir-faire.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i></div>
                    <h4>Échangez sans argent</h4>
                    <p>1 heure de cours d'anglais = 1 heure de programmation. Équitable et accessible.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-users-cog"></i></div>
                    <h4>Communauté de confiance</h4>
                    <p>Avis, notation, vérification des profils — un espace sécurisé pour apprendre.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="concept-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i></div>
                    <h4>Planification flexible</h4>
                    <p>Présentiel ou en ligne, gérez vos disponibilités et réservez en quelques clics.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ===== FEATURES SECTION ===== -->
        <div class="features-section">
            <div class="features-header">
                <h2>Comment ça fonctionne ?</h2>
                <p>Une plateforme simple, sécurisée et équitable pour tous</p>
            </div>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i></div>
                    <h4>1. Créez votre profil</h4>
                    <p>Inscrivez-vous, ajoutez vos compétences et ce que vous souhaitez apprendre. Recevez 1h offerte pour démarrer.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-search"></i></div>
                    <h4>2. Trouvez des échanges</h4>
                    <p>Recherchez par compétence, niveau, ville ou format. Découvrez des profils et proposez un échange.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
                    <h4>3. Échangez et apprenez</h4>
                    <p>Planifiez une session, échangez vos compétences et gagnez des crédits-temps pour vos prochains apprentissages.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
                    <h4>4. Construisez votre réputation</h4>
                    <p>Notez et laissez des avis après chaque session. Une communauté de confiance se construit ensemble.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
    <!-- end home-card -->

</body>
</html>